    "a8807b829bc3a2290db2715605ee4cb3788e8bfd7a2240c0f5d299d5252e1c74": {
      "normalizationVersion": 1,
      "sourceHash": "b7a273b6437566064bd4c32eaa50a01bff8172dce90dfb549cddd6b3b7c3c314",
      "contextFingerprint": "ebcb409bd1adc5c50303426a6e8d638022049d7b01435fa5fcab25307240aa1d",
      "sourceText": "- `std::thread t(f, args...)` 的第一个参数是可调用对象，后面的参数是传给它的实参。\n- 线程参数默认会被保存，引用语义通常要显式使用 `std::ref()` / `std::cref()`。\n- `join()` 等待线程结束，并让线程对象变为 non-joinable。\n- `detach()` 让线程脱离当前 `std::thread` 对象，生命周期风险较大。\n- `joinable()` 判断对象是否仍关联一个可 join 的线程，不等于线程此刻是否正在运行。\n- joinable 的 `std::thread` 析构会调用 `std::terminate()`。\n- `std::thread` 不可复制，但可以移动。\n- 线程共享引用、指针或对象时，必须额外考虑对象生命周期和数据竞争。",
      "translatedText": "- `std::thread t(f, args...)`The first parameter is a callable object, and the subsequent parameters are the arguments passed to it\\.\n- Thread parameters are saved by default; reference semantics usually require explicit use of `std::ref()` / `std::cref()`\\.\n- `join()` Waits for the thread to finish and makes the thread object become non-joinable\\.\n- `detach()` Detaches the thread from the current `std::thread` object; the lifetime risk is relatively high\\.\n- `joinable()` Determines whether the object is still associated with a joinable thread; it is not equal to whether the thread is currently running\\.\n- A joinable `std::thread` destructor calls `std::terminate()`\\.\n- `std::thread` It is not copyable, but it can be moved\\.\n- When threads share references, pointers, or objects, object lifetime and data races must be considered additionally\\.",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 259,
        "outputTokens": 159,
        "costUsd": 0.000269
      }
